# Main PR Integration & Release — Task Plan & Implementation Log

## Plan
- **High-level goal:** Safely integrate and merge the 6 active feature branches (`profile-setting`, `v2-user-accounts`, `v2-audit`, `v2-colleges-and-programs`, `v2-accreditation-visits`, `v2-documents`) into `v2-main` via GitHub Pull Request(s).
- **Scope:**
  - 188 unique files across the 6 feature branches.
  - 81 automated tests (567 assertions).
  - Clean build verification with Vite / Tailwind CSS v4 / DaisyUI.
- **Key Findings & Conflict Surface:**
  - Out of 188 files touched, only 3 files have minor overlapping edits (all additive):
    1. `v2/src/routes/web.php`: Route registrations under the `/admin` prefix (`/users`, `/colleges`, `/audit-logs`).
    2. `v2/src/app/Http/Controllers/AdminController.php`: Method additions (`users()`, `colleges()`).
    3. `v2/src/database/seeders/DatabaseSeeder.php`: Seeder additions (`AuditLogSeeder`, `InstitutionalAccreditationSeeder`, `SampleBugElementaryEducationSeeder`).
- **Validation Strategy:**
  - Full automated feature tests: `php artisan test` (all 81 tests passing).
  - Complete asset compilation: `npm run build` (0 build errors).
  - Desktop-only layout and DaisyUI component consistency audit.

